WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 4.1 · People, Culture & Volunteers
Workforce planning

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Plan the people your strategy needs: which roles, how much time, which type, and when.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Start from your roles and the time each needs.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Count volunteer support costs, not only salaries.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Name single points of failure and who covers.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Six staff and 25 volunteer mentors with transport allowances; a half-time fundraising officer next year as Foundation A ends.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write a one-to-two-year workforce plan with continuity risks.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
